[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10TG-78
TITLE: Enable window switching after emission delivery - (unlock layout) Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
Verify that the layout unlocks when the emission is completed, allowing navigation to other tabs.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
Load a plan for treatment in the Heracles Internal unit.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Log in to the External application. 

2. Navigate to the treatment view. 

3. Press the Prepare button to prepare the treatment. 

4. Press the Beam-On button to trigger emission delivery. 

5. Click the Log tab 

6. Upon completion of the emission, approve the confirmation pop-up. 

7. Click the Log tab
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
1. The user should be able to navigate to Log view. 

2. The layout should be unlocked so the user can navigate to all views.
<<<

[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10TG-112
TITLE: Treatment View - Reset Timers and Unload Plan after Treatment is Completed
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case verifies the loading of treatment plans into the system. It validates that all plan parameters are correctly loaded and displayed.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Log in to the External application. 

2. Navigate to the treatment view. 

3. Press the Prepare button to prepare the treatment. 

4. Press the Beam-On button to trigger emission delivery. 

5. Wait until the plan is delivered and the pop-up appears. 

6. Press ok button
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
5. A pop message should be displayed informing the user that the emission is finished and by pressing the OK button, the timers will be 
reset and the plan will unload. 

6. The timers in the telemetry block will show 0, and the plan will disappear from the view.
<<<

