[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10TG-81
TITLE: Treatment Console - Radiation Emission Control - Resume Beam On process after error is cleared - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
Verify that the Resume button correctly resumes emission from the latest operational point and remaining time after an clearing an error.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
1)Create treatment field with duration of 12 Seconds and Load a plan for treatment in the Heracles Internal unit . 

2) The ability to intentionally create an error in the system.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Log in to the External application. 

2. Navigate to the treatment view. 

3. Press the Prepare button to prepare the treatment. 

4. Press the Beam-On button to trigger emission delivery. 

5. After 8 seconds (check elapsed time), create an intended error in the system (e.g., activate the e-stop) 

6. Observe the error 

7. Click the Clear Error button 

8. Click the Resume button.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
When the resume process is triggered, the emission should resume for the remaining duration (4 Seconds).
<<<

