[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H10TG-44
TITLE: Treatment Console - Radiation Emission Control - Layout - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
This test case verifies the layout and user interface components of the Treatment Console. It validates that all UI elements are properly displayed and arranged according to specifications.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
Load a plan for treatment in the Heracles Internal unit. 

Verify the existence of an interface through which the user can initiate radiation delivery in accordance with a predefined treatment plan.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Log in to the External application. 

2. Navigate to the treatment view.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
2 - The layout of the main (treatment) view includes the following: 

A table listing the treatment fields of the plan. 

System telemetry view including: System status, Main timer (in seconds), Backup Timer 1 (in seconds), Backup Timer 2 (in seconds), 
Energy (in KV), Current (in mA). 

Action panel: 

• Prepare button 

• Beam on 

• Stop button 

Interlock icon 

System Signal icon 

Live Camera view to monitor the patient.
<<<

